       cue=["Dehydration, long standing/bed rest.", "Medicines: diuretics, BP medicines, beta blockers, Parkinson's, tricyclics, ED drugs + nitrates.", "Heart: slow rate, valves, failure.", "Thyroid, low sugar, anaemia.", "Emergency causes: bleed, severe infection, severe allergy."],
